  "ruleText": "Lab 1502.07 “Person” means “person” as defined in RSA 277-B:2, V-a, namely “any individual, partnership, corporation, limited liability company, association, or other legal entity.”\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12 (from Lab 1502.06); ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22 (formerly Lab 1502.06)",
